course: dictionary
lesson: 15697
title: Tolerance
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Tolerance means accepting and respecting people whose beliefs, ways of life or opinions are different from yours, even when you disagree with them. «We learn tolerance by listening to people who think differently from us.»
explain: Tolerance can also mean being able to put up with something unpleasant, such as pain, heat or noise. «She has a low tolerance for cold» means she does not like the cold and feels it quickly.
explain: In medicine, tolerance means the body gets used to a medicine, so the medicine works less well. In engineering, a tolerance is the small amount a measurement may differ from the exact size. The words around the word tell you which meaning is meant.
fact: Tolerance is a noun.
fact: «Tolerance» can mean accepting people who are different from you, even if you disagree with them.
fact: «Tolerance» can also mean being able to put up with pain, heat or noise.
fact: «Zero tolerance» means no bad behaviour is allowed at all.
fact: In design and technology, a tolerance is the small allowed difference from an exact size, such as ±0.5 mm.
exercise: «Our school teaches tolerance and respect for everyone.» What does tolerance mean here? | Being too hot in the sun | A type of medicine | *Accepting people who are different from you | A tiny gap in a machine part
exercise: «Sam has a low tolerance for loud noise, so he covers his ears.» What does a low tolerance for noise mean? | He cannot hear at all | He loves loud noise | *He does not put up with loud noise well | He makes lots of noise
exercise: «Over time, her body built up tolerance, so the medicine worked less.» In medicine, what does tolerance mean? | A medicine is made of tiny parts | *The body gets used to a medicine, so it works less | The medicine works faster each day | The medicine tastes nicer
test: «The part has a tolerance of ±0.5 mm.» What does tolerance mean in this sentence? | The time it takes to make the part | The strength of the metal | *The small amount the size may differ from the exact size | The number of parts in a box
test: Which phrase means that no bad behaviour is allowed at all? | Low tolerance | *Zero tolerance | Tolerance and respect | Mutual respect
exam: Which sentence uses tolerance to mean accepting people with different beliefs? | «She has a low tolerance for heat.» | «The tolerance on the bolt is very small.» | «He took the medicine every day for a week.» | *«We show tolerance to friends who believe different things.»
